Learner should not go on to discuss perspective for visit but should revisit Mary’s narrative with her from the beginning, exploring and empathizing with:

* Trauma of abrupt change from excellent health to illness;
* Self -blame regarding ignoring symptoms;
* Trauma of lack of relationship with doctor giving bad news;
* Stress of being told she has stage III cancer;
* Worry about not having entire tumor removed.
